<title>HONG KONG: Union Bank of HK sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Union Bank of HK sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger Jardine Fleming Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNION BANK OF HONG KONG LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$500 MLN  COUPON     4MH+45BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH    16.APR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 3 &amp; 4    CALLS	YR 3 &amp; 4  REPLIES  END APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	  SALE LMTS  CUSTOMARY TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  HONG KONG   PAY DATE   NOT YET FIXED</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS     HK$75 MLN     60.0BP   ALL-IN  65.0</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS  HK$50-74 MLN  52.5BP   ALL-IN  62.5</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	   HK$25-49 MLN  45.0BP   ALL-IN  60.0</p>
<p>ARRANGERS AND BOOKRUNNERS</p>
<p>SCHRODERS ASIA AND JARDINE FLEMING BANK</p>
<p> NOTES   THERE IS A SHAREHOLDERS' MAINTENANCE CLAUSE THAT</p>
<p>	   HOLDERS CAN EXERCISE PUT OPTION IF CHINA MERCHANTS</p>
<p>	   HOLDINGS CO LTD HOLDS LESS THAN 50 PCT OF THE ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
